    "scope": "The named A7/Afsluitdijk curve and the two lock sites fix the NE/SW and Wadden Sea/IJsselmeer sides. Model geometry, road transitions and masks share the viewer’s Web Mercator projection. Tests exercise the original PMTiles buildings and roads, local standard terrain and stock water renderer. Fixed sea-level attachment and local water styling are illustrative.",
    "notes": "Fine PMTiles near the sluices and retained z12 terrain cover the placement probes. Sluice extensions use two bounded exterior-photo water corrections. Mainland joins blend to standard terrain. The future fish passage extension and date-specific water levels remain approximate."
  },
